.subckt sigma_adc vss vdd vip vin vp vn vcm ctrl_a ctrl_b c1a c1b c2a c2b intp intn inp inn
CSP sp bp 200f
CSN sn bn 200f
CIP inp intp 400f
CIN inn intn 400f
RDP vp refp 100
RCP refp vcm 6.4k
RDN vn refn 100
RCN refn vcm 6.4k

XHPP holdp ctrl_a vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1.68
